Pokok = Rp 41.666.667,-&lt;br&gt;
Bunga = 10% x Rp 2.000.000.000,- / 365 x 31 = Rp 16.986.301,-&lt;br&gt;
Angsuran Total = 41.666.667 + 16.986.301 = Rp 58.652.968,-&lt;br&gt;
